        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This will confirm our understanding that the Pension Plan provisions, included in the 1998 CWA/IBEW/Lucent National Memorandum of Understanding and inserted below, shall continue in effect in accordance with their original terms during the life of the 2003 MOU.",
